  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2401201",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arouet",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240127101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240127101": {
            "id": "240127101",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Chatelet just ordered a <color=#00E1FFFF>Latte</color>.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240127102"
            ]
          },
          "240127102": {
            "id": "240127102",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "First, you'll need to mix <color=#00E1FFFF>one portion of coffee extract and milk each</color> completely, before capping it off with <color=#00E1FFFF>a serving of milk foam</color>.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240127103"
            ]
          },
          "240127103": {
            "id": "240127103",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Milk foam is a special ingredient we've got here. Making it involves preparing another serving of milk, washing and drying this tube here at the coffee machine...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240127104"
            ]
          },
          "240127104": {
            "id": "240127104",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Before stabbing the tube into the milk at this angle... Uh, you know what, I'll just help you make that. It's a bit much to ask a beginner to make the foam..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401215",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240125101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240125101": {
            "id": "240125101",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Ah, you don't have to make coffee for any of our guests today.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240125102"
            ]
          },
          "240125102": {
            "id": "240125102",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "You've helped out a lot at the store, and your brewing skills have been getting better by the day. To be honest, I'd say you're qualified to be an official coffee maker.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240125105"
            ]
          },
          "240125105": {
            "id": "240125105",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Ah, I'm afraid we'll have to talk about the trouble that Mr. Macadell brought us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240125140"
            ]
          },
          "240125140": {
            "id": "240125140",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "This fellow from the Palais has absolutely no knowledge about coffee, but he certainly is a master at making something out of nothing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240125106"
            ]
          },
          "240125106": {
            "id": "240125106",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "He has requested that all cafés implement a system he designed, and that we accept the Palais Mermonia's supervision.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240125107"
            ]
          },
          "240125107": {
            "id": "240125107",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "To be more specific, the abilities of all employed coffee makers must be \"assessed,\" and assigned a level from 1 to 5.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240125108"
            ]
          },
          "240125108": {
            "id": "240125108",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "This assessment not only includes a 27-page exam, but also a series of practical tests, ranging from basic to advanced.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240125109"
            ]
          },
          "240125109": {
            "id": "240125109",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Once that process is complete, Mr. Macadell and his fellow make-work specialists will distribute level certificates to the coffee makers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240125110"
            ]
          },
          "240125110": {
            "id": "240125110",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Someone with a certificate is \"official,\" and the opposite is true of those without.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240125111"
            ]
          },
          "240125111": {
            "id": "240125111",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "And what's the purpose of said certificate?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240125112"
            ]
          },
          "240125112": {
            "id": "240125112",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "As far as I and others in this line can see, not much, at least with regard to brewing coffee.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240125113"
            ]
          },
          "240125113": {
            "id": "240125113",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "It will not make someone's brew tasty or terrible, nor will it affect the maker's ability to make coffee.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240125114"
            ]
          },
          "240125114": {
            "id": "240125114",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "What it does do, however, is allow Mr. Macadell to set up a Coffee Management Office — under his personal banner again, no less — with a whole bunch of subordinates under him."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401202",
      "subQuestName": "Start brewing coffee",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240120202"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240120202": {
            "id": "240120202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm ready.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120203"
            ]
          },
          "240120203": {
            "id": "240120203",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Very good. Then let's begin. If you have any questions, feel free to ask me again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401203",
      "subQuestName": "Start brewing Special Blend Coffee",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240120301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240120301": {
            "id": "240120301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(It's time to add the coffee brew's ingredients in...)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401204",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arouet",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240120401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240120401": {
            "id": "240120401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "The coffee is brewed in a precise and efficient manner...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120402"
            ]
          },
          "240120402": {
            "id": "240120402",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "What stunning flavor, and what a rich aroma... Let me have a taste...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120403"
            ]
          },
          "240120403": {
            "id": "240120403",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Perfection! This flavor is perfect — you're a natural!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120404"
            ]
          },
          "240120404": {
            "id": "240120404",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Surely you exaggerate...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120405"
            ]
          },
          "240120405": {
            "id": "240120405",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Come now! It is precisely that unnecessary humility that has kept your talent buried. I'm sure of it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120406"
            ]
          },
          "240120406": {
            "id": "240120406",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Congratulations! From now on, you're a proper coffee maker!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120407"
            ]
          },
          "240120407": {
            "id": "240120407",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Right, please take this cup, then. House rules state that every proper coffee maker must have their very own coffee cup.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120408"
            ]
          },
          "240120408": {
            "id": "240120408",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "This cup will remain in the store — just use it whenever you stop by for a coffee.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120409"
            ]
          },
          "240120409": {
            "id": "240120409",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Once I'm ready, I'll talk to dear Mr. Macadell at the Coffee Management Office to have you noted down as an official coffee maker.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120410"
            ]
          },
          "240120410": {
            "id": "240120410",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Let's hope he's amenable... Hmph..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
