    {
      "subId": "2401211",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arouet",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240121101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240121101": {
            "id": "240121101",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Excellent! Our customers are most satisfied with your work. You do have a gift, if I do say so myself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240121102"
            ]
          },
          "240121102": {
            "id": "240121102",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "If you have time in the future, please do come around more often — you'll be welcome as a guest and a coffee maker both.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240121103"
            ]
          },
          "240121103": {
            "id": "240121103",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "If you'll let me add my two Mora, I'd say that should you put in the work, it's only a matter of time before you become truly great at this."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401201",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240120101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240120101": {
            "id": "240120101",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Hello, welcome! What would you like to have?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120106"
            ]
          },
          "240120106": {
            "id": "240120106",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Name the flavor you favor, then find a seat — coffee to savor will be with you in a beat.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120107"
            ]
          },
          "240120107": {
            "id": "240120107",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "But a word to the wise — best to keep your distance from the other customers while you find your spot.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120110"
            ]
          },
          "240120110": {
            "id": "240120110",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Well, I wouldn't say so. On the contrary, those who drink coffee are dying to unburden themselves to a companion — if they were to get hold of you, you'd be here all day.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120111"
            ]
          },
          "240120111": {
            "id": "240120111",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You sound like you're describing drunkards...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120112"
            ]
          },
          "240120112": {
            "id": "240120112",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "And would you believe me if I said that drunkards would be easier to handle? Call the police on them, and they'll sober up right away.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120113"
            ]
          },
          "240120113": {
            "id": "240120113",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "But clarity is what the chatty gentlepeople here have in spades — and before one of you concedes, not even fists will shut their mouths.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120114"
            ]
          },
          "240120114": {
            "id": "240120114",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "And that's why I advise you to keep your distance, or your early impression of our dear Fontaine may go ill.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120115"
            ]
          },
          "240120115": {
            "id": "240120115",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "And why are they like... this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120116"
            ]
          },
          "240120116": {
            "id": "240120116",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Now, if you were to ask me... Why, I'd say our coffee is so delicious that our customers can't help but slowly savor every sip. They could never bear to down it in one go!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120117"
            ]
          },
          "240120117": {
            "id": "240120117",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Then, unable to withstand the void created in their souls by the lack of our wondrous brew, they must find someone to speak to and pass the time... I jest, of course.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120118"
            ]
          },
          "240120118": {
            "id": "240120118",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "A café is like a tavern — it is a place to relax. After a long day of work, few have any lack of complaints about how their day went, and such.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120119"
            ]
          },
          "240120119": {
            "id": "240120119",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Of course, I have little doubt that drinking wine is more effective than coffee — yet it comes with a risk that its counterpart lacks...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120120"
            ]
          },
          "240120120": {
            "id": "240120120",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "If one takes to having a drink to go with any given complaint, one will be liable to drink too much and lose one's wits.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120121"
            ]
          },
          "240120121": {
            "id": "240120121",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That does go pretty badly, yes...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120122"
            ]
          },
          "240120122": {
            "id": "240120122",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Indeed. I once met someone from the Palais Mermonia. He's usually a polite, patient, and meticulous fellow.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120123"
            ]
          },
          "240120123": {
            "id": "240120123",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "One day, he had too much to drink, and asserted that he was an apple tree, even shouting that someone had uprooted him and stripped him of his bark... Of course, he'd taken those clothes off himself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120124"
            ]
          },
          "240120124": {
            "id": "240120124",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "And then he searched high and low for tree pits, proclaiming loudly that he must return to the soil, else wither and perish.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120125"
            ]
          },
          "240120125": {
            "id": "240120125",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Fortunately, some quick-thinking fellow had us dig a pit right there, and when we were done, we pointed at it and hollered \"What's this? We're missing an apple tree over here!\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120126"
            ]
          },
          "240120126": {
            "id": "240120126",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Hearing that, Mr. Apple Tree leaped into the trench like one hearing a siren, and even urged us to pile some soil atop him... In the end, he fell asleep with half his body still sticking out of the earth.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120127"
            ]
          },
          "240120127": {
            "id": "240120127",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Thus was peace restored... Though the person who came up with the idea did get a little unlucky..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401202",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240120201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240120201": {
            "id": "240120201",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Ready to start blending some coffee?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120204"
            ]
          },
          "240120204": {
            "id": "240120204",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I've got other matters to attend to at the moment...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240120205"
            ]
          },
          "240120205": {
            "id": "240120205",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Just tell me once you're ready. If you have any questions, just ask away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401252",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240125201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240125201": {
            "id": "240125201",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "It seems that your calm's been disturbed. Your technique is a jumble, and no mistake.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240125202"
            ]
          },
          "240125202": {
            "id": "240125202",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "It's alright, it happens to the best of us. Learn to relax — this is a cup of coffee, not life and death.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240125203"
            ]
          },
          "240125203": {
            "id": "240125203",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Believe me, you have talent, you just need to stay calm, and you'll do fantastic work."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401261",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240126101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240126101": {
            "id": "240126101",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Ah, you're finally here. I've been hanging on by a thread here, just so you know! Come, get behind the counter.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240126102"
            ]
          },
          "240126102": {
            "id": "240126102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Lots of customers, I presume?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240126103"
            ]
          },
          "240126103": {
            "id": "240126103",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Oh, you bet, and unexpectedly so! We haven't had an empty seat since the day you came to help out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240126104"
            ]
          },
          "240126104": {
            "id": "240126104",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "I mean, what did I tell you? You're a natural! If you're willing, you can just stay here and help me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240126105"
            ]
          },
          "240126105": {
            "id": "240126105",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "If things go well, I might even be able to help you open a branch of your own!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240126108"
            ]
          },
          "240126108": {
            "id": "240126108",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Alright, alright, you busy bee. You were running like the wind last I saw you pass the store by — why, one would think you were being pursued, the way you ran!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240126109"
            ]
          },
          "240126109": {
            "id": "240126109",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "But since you're here, I suppose that a slot's opened up?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401272",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240127201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240127201": {
            "id": "240127201",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Officer Menthe seems to have something important to do. She's ordered a cup of <color=#00E1FFFF>Clarity Coffee</color>.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240127202"
            ]
          },
          "240127202": {
            "id": "240127202",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "You need <color=#00E1FFFF>one portion of coffee and drinking water each</color>. Take the cup with coffee in it and pour the water in, and you're done. Easy peasy, eh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240127203"
            ]
          },
          "240127203": {
            "id": "240127203",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Now, I can't say I'm fond of this rather flippant way of making coffee, what with it ignoring flavor and all...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240127204"
            ]
          },
          "240127204": {
            "id": "240127204",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "But it is very quick, and it only requires coffee extract and water. There's no milk or any other ingredients, so its energizing effects are very apparent...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240127205"
            ]
          },
          "240127205": {
            "id": "240127205",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Which makes it perfect for someone who's constantly having to power through physical and mental exhaustion at work every day.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240127206"
            ]
          },
          "240127206": {
            "id": "240127206",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "*sigh* That Officer Menthe..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401273",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240127301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240127301": {
            "id": "240127301",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Chatelet seems to be in a good mood today. She's ordered <color=#00E1FFFF>a cup of Milk Coffee</color>.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240127302"
            ]
          },
          "240127302": {
            "id": "240127302",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "You'll need <color=#00E1FFFF>one portion of coffee extract</color> and <color=#00E1FFFF>milk</color> each. After mixing the two, you'll need to add some <color=#00E1FFFF>cream</color> over the top to finish it up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240127303"
            ]
          },
          "240127303": {
            "id": "240127303",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Have you tried our specially-made cream? It smells really good, is as soft as a cloud, and isn't too sweet...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240127304"
            ]
          },
          "240127304": {
            "id": "240127304",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Huh? Oh, don't worry, you won't have to make any yourself — just use the stock we have in the store. I was just introducing it to you, that's all..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401274",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240127401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240127401": {
            "id": "240127401",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Officer Menthe appears to have encountered something troublesome... She's ordered an <color=#00E1FFFF>Espresso</color>.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240127402"
            ]
          },
          "240127402": {
            "id": "240127402",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "You just need to mix these <color=#00E1FFFF>two portions of coffee</color> together to make it, and add some dessert on the side. As I recall, she's fond of cakes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240127403"
            ]
          },
          "240127403": {
            "id": "240127403",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "*sigh* She seems more tired than ever..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401281",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240128101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240128101": {
            "id": "240128101",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Hmm... There's something off about this Clarity Coffee...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240128102"
            ]
          },
          "240128102": {
            "id": "240128102",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "You need <color=#00E1FFFF>one portion of coffee</color> and <color=#00E1FFFF>drinking water</color> each. Take the cup with coffee in it and pour the water in, and you're done.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240128103"
            ]
          },
          "240128103": {
            "id": "240128103",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Please try it again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401282",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240128201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240128201": {
            "id": "240128201",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Hmm... There's something not quite right about this Milk Coffee...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240128202"
            ]
          },
          "240128202": {
            "id": "240128202",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "You'll need <color=#00E1FFFF>one portion of coffee extract</color> and <color=#00E1FFFF>milk</color> each to make it. Finally, after mixing the two, you'll need to add some <color=#00E1FFFF>cream</color> over the top to finish it up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240128203"
            ]
          },
          "240128203": {
            "id": "240128203",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Please try it again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401283",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240128301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240128301": {
            "id": "240128301",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Hmm... There's something odd about this Espresso...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240128302"
            ]
          },
          "240128302": {
            "id": "240128302",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "You just need to mix these <color=#00E1FFFF>two portions of coffee</color> together, and you're done.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240128303"
            ]
          },
          "240128303": {
            "id": "240128303",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Please try it again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401284",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240128401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240128401": {
            "id": "240128401",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Have you finished making the coffee?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240128403",
              "240128406"
            ]
          },
          "240128403": {
            "id": "240128403",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "First, you'll need to mix <color=#00E1FFFF>one portion of coffee extract</color> and <color=#00E1FFFF>one portion of milk</color> together completely.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240128404"
            ]
          },
          "240128404": {
            "id": "240128404",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "After that, you need to cap it off with <color=#00E1FFFF>a serving of milk foam</color>... which I've already prepared for you. It's over there."
          },
          "240128406": {
            "id": "240128406",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "I'm looking forward to the coffee that you'll make."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401285",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240128501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240128501": {
            "id": "240128501",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "Is something the matter?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240128503",
              "240128505"
            ]
          },
          "240128503": {
            "id": "240128503",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "You need <color=#00E1FFFF>one portion of coffee and drinking water each</color>. Take the cup with coffee in it and pour the water in, and you're done. Easy-peasy."
          },
          "240128505": {
            "id": "240128505",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "I'm looking forward to the coffee that you'll make."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401286",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240128601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240128601": {
            "id": "240128601",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "What can I do for you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240128603",
              "240128605"
            ]
          },
          "240128603": {
            "id": "240128603",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "You'll need <color=#00E1FFFF>one portion of coffee extract</color> and <color=#00E1FFFF>milk</color> each. After mixing the two, you'll need to add some <color=#00E1FFFF>cream</color> over the top to finish it up."
          },
          "240128605": {
            "id": "240128605",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "I'm looking forward to the coffee that you'll make."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401287",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240128701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240128701": {
            "id": "240128701",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "What can I do for you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240128703",
              "240128705"
            ]
          },
          "240128703": {
            "id": "240128703",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "You just need to mix these <color=#00E1FFFF>two portions of coffee</color> together — and if Officer Menthe comes along, pair it with a cake."
          },
          "240128705": {
            "id": "240128705",
            "speakerId": 5053,
            "speakerName": "Arouet",
            "text": "I'm looking forward to the coffee that you'll make."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2401299",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240129901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240129901": {
            "id": "240129901",
            "speakerId": 5054,
            "speakerName": "Chatelet",
            "text": "*sigh* Couldn't Arouet say a little less for once...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240129902"
            ]
          },
          "240129902": {
            "id": "240129902",
            "speakerId": 5043,
            "speakerName": "Menthe",
            "text": "There's still a lot to do... Gotta keep it together...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240129903"
            ]
          },
          "240129903": {
            "id": "240129903",
            "speakerId": 5054,
            "speakerName": "Chatelet",
            "text": "Ooh, this coffee will definitely be great!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240129904"
            ]
          },
          "240129904": {
            "id": "240129904",
            "speakerId": 5043,
            "speakerName": "Menthe",
            "text": "Keep it together... Stay awake... Keep it together..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}